              "note": "Spec path components.schemas.ConversionCoupon — dateValid is the per-issuance expiry lever BR-P1-016 needs. Whether it is enforced or merely recorded is exactly the kind of semantics the spec cannot answer.",
              "excerpt": "\"dateValid\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"date-time\"}"
            }
          ]
